Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.79,0:00:05.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,C'mon, Bonfire, hurry up and free me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.63,0:00:09.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I can't exactly eat toast\Nwith my hands tied behind my back.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.75,0:00:15.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Are you sure it was a good idea\Nbringing him with us, Teach?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.88,0:00:19.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He's the only one who knows\Nwhat Purple Ant looks like.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.08,0:00:21.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, that makes him valuable.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.00,0:00:25.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thanks kindly.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.83,0:00:27.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I have a question for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.21,0:00:29.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Do you remember Olivia?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.92,0:00:32.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Huh? Of course I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.88,0:00:36.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Tell me, did you love her?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.04,0:00:37.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.54,0:00:39.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,All I had to do was whisper\Nsweet nothings in her ear,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.67,0:00:42.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and that pawn of a woman was\Nwilling to risk her life for-
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.42,0:00:44.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Grete?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.75,0:00:45.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.21,0:00:51.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thea...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.75,0:00:54.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Would you be able to peer into that man's heart?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.46,0:00:57.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The sooner we get that intel out of him,\Nthe sooner we can give him a pair of cement shoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.58,0:01:00.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I never expected that he would rile you up so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.29,0:01:02.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I understand how you feel, but I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.25,0:01:07.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Every time I try to look him in the eye,\Nhe puts his guard up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.25,0:01:09.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We can just leave him as-is for the time being.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.29,0:01:11.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,From what I've found,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.58,0:01:15.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,there's been a string of murders,\Nsuspicious deaths, and disappearances
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.38,0:01:17.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,taking place in secret here in Mitario.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.75,0:01:21.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The vast majority of the victims were\Nintelligence operatives
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.04,0:01:23.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,who got involved with\Nthe Tolfa Economic Conference.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.00,0:01:27.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The murder methods cover the spectrum.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.25,0:01:30.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There have been stabbings, strangulations,\Nvehicular assaults made to look like suicides,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.25,0:01:31.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and accidents...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.75,0:01:35.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And you think that the Galgad Empire's\NSerpent team is behind it all, Boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.88,0:01:38.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It wouldn't surprise me if they had someone\Ncapable of pulling that off.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.54,0:01:42.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They're killing off enemy spies\Nand shifting things in the Empire's favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.88,0:01:48.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I want you all to continue approaching\Nconference attendees and gathering intel.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.50,0:01:50.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.71,0:01:53.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Our ultimate goal for this mission
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.00,0:01:57.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,is to capture Purple Ant,\Nthe Serpent member who's infiltrated the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.50,0:02:01.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm going to be operating independently\Nand interrogating anyone who seems shady.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.13,0:02:05.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,All that said, make sure you don't take\Nany unnecessary risks.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.96,0:02:09.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Remember, we're up against the people who\Nmanaged to bring the legendary Inferno team low.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.38,0:02:11.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.67,0:02:56.83,Song,,0,0,0,,My eyes were opened up wide
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.83,0:03:01.79,Song,,0,0,0,,By a scene that rent my heart
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.21,0:03:04.79,Song,,0,0,0,,See it flitting, flitting through the gaps in your fingers
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.79,0:03:07.46,Song,,0,0,0,,Stare at the truth as it comes into view
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.46,0:03:12.42,Song,,0,0,0,,Is what's been built here paradise?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.42,0:03:16.21,Song,,0,0,0,,Tumbling down head over heels
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.21,0:03:20.08,Song,,0,0,0,,Oh, I know this might be a wasteland
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.08,0:03:27.38,Song,,0,0,0,,But I have to land so I can survive on my own
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.54,0:03:28.54,Song,,0,0,0,,I have to go now
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.54,0:03:32.17,Song,,0,0,0,,I vomited up magificent blood
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.17,0:03:38.58,Song,,0,0,0,,That these flowers I planted here might bloom eternal
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.58,0:03:44.04,Song,,0,0,0,,I love this hopeless world enough to give
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.04,0:03:50.17,Song,,0,0,0,,All that my lungs and my legs and my hands have to give for it
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.54,0:03:57.21,Song,,0,0,0,,And I swear I'll find a dream
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.21,0:04:03.21,Song,,0,0,0,,That was worth all this sorrow
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.75,0:04:14.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Goodness me, you really saved my bacon there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.46,0:04:15.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Please, don't hold back.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.46,0:04:16.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Order as much as you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.96,0:04:18.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,For real?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.42,0:04:20.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,In that case, let's start out...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.83,0:04:22.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,with one of everything from here to here!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.67,0:04:27.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's no wonder you're VP of one of the\Nleading tea manufacturers in the Bumal Kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.50,0:04:28.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You've got a big heart!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.88,0:04:31.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thanks for this, and for agreeing to\Ngive me an exclusive interview.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.13,0:04:32.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's my pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.83,0:04:36.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Still, I can't believe someone stole my briefcase\Nright out of that coffee shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.25,0:04:41.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Who knows where I'd be\Nif you hadn't gallantly retrieved it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.38,0:04:44.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's a shame they never caught whoever did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.46,0:04:46.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Details, details.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.13,0:04:49.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,More importantly, you are going to\Npublish that article, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.71,0:04:54.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I've given interviews to a number of reporters,\Nbut none of them ever make it to print.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.96,0:04:56.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.17,0:04:58.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I guess I'm just unlucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.08,0:05:01.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I don't know why, but none of\Nthe reporters even return my calls.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.67,0:05:02.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How rude is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.21,0:05:05.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,By the way, who's your friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.21,0:05:07.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's Barron.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.00,0:05:11.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They were supposed to send a chauffeur\Nout from the motherland,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.71,0:05:13.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but he came down with food poisoning.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.79,0:05:15.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I had to find a local replacement in a hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.29,0:05:17.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oui.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.63,0:05:19.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He might look scary, but he's good at what he does.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.58,0:05:23.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You told me you were a middleweight boxer\Nup until a few years ago, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.08,0:05:26.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oui, I had to retire when I tore my ligament.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.21,0:05:28.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ah, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.96,0:05:29.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oui.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.00,0:05:37.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And where is it you're taking me, Miranda?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.83,0:05:40.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don’t worry, I think you'll like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.50,0:05:43.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're trying to make friends\Nwith deep pockets, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.46,0:05:46.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This place has enough fat cats\Nto make your head spin.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.83,0:05:57.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,An underground casino, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.75,0:06:01.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What's a college student like you doing\Nhanging around somewhere this sketchy?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.75,0:06:03.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,My uncle's a regular.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.63,0:06:06.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He brought me here once, and I got hooked.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.17,0:06:09.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A dart?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.38,0:06:10.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This place is pretty exclusive.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.75,0:06:14.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It'll help grease the wheels if you play a round\Nbefore I start introducing you around.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.67,0:06:15.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Do you know the rules?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.88,0:06:18.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.29,0:06:22.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You throw three darts a round,\Nand we take turns and compete on score.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.67,0:06:25.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,When you throw them, you want to do it like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.92,0:06:33.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,By the way, that spot I just hit was the triple 20.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.21,0:06:36.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's the most valuable spot on the board.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.83,0:06:39.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So, like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.54,0:06:45.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.96,0:06:47.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Nice throws.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.67,0:06:52.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wow, you're really something.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.42,0:06:53.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You were right, this is easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.58,0:06:56.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, I don't plan on losing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.04,0:06:57.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't have it any other way.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.29,0:07:00.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How are they doing that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.96,0:07:12.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So, how do you know who wins?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.08,0:07:14.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Normally, it ends after eight rounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.21,0:07:16.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And what if it's a tie?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.42,0:07:18.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There's a special rule\Nwhere you play overtime rounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.33,0:07:19.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Who designed this dumb game?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.92,0:07:21.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We'll be here for the rest of our lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.63,0:07:31.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, guess we gotta keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.54,0:07:34.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't rack up too many points if I were you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.50,0:07:35.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Why's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.88,0:07:37.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Down here, we play for keeps.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.50,0:07:42.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If you lose, you have to pay the winner\Na hundred donnies for every point they got.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.38,0:07:45.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're awful, Miranda.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.29,0:07:47.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You never told me we were gambling.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.00,0:07:50.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If I lose, I'll owe you more than the average person\Nin this country makes in four years.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.63,0:07:52.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There's no way I could pay that much.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.46,0:07:54.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're welcome to pay with your body.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.25,0:07:56.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This place runs strip shows.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.38,0:07:57.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They're pretty nasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.83,0:08:00.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The performers get dissected...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.50,0:08:02.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,with a big old guillotine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.42,0:08:10.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll never understand the stuff rich people are into.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.92,0:08:12.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Lillian, you've got some guests.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.63,0:08:14.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They say they've got a few questions for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.67,0:08:16.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They're waiting out back.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.25,0:08:18.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll get right on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.29,0:08:21.96,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,I dunno why, but I'm getting bad vibes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.96,0:08:26.67,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,I guess all that experience has\Nawakened my spy instincts.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.67,0:08:29.63,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Whoever's looking for me is an enemy.\NI'm sure of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.38,0:08:31.58,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,No worries, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.58,0:08:35.33,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,I'll just use the techniques Teach taught me\Nto turn the tables on 'em!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.29,0:08:40.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.08,0:08:42.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I think I drank too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.29,0:08:44.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Where's the VP?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.83,0:08:45.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oui.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.83,0:08:47.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He and his secretary left for another bar.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.29,0:08:51.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He asked me to give you a ride home.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.00,0:08:53.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I really 'ppreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.75,0:08:54.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oops...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.75,0:08:55.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.42,0:08:59.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it.\NI'll go get you some water.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.29,0:09:04.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You lookin' for these?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.38,0:09:05.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sleeping pills.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.04,0:09:09.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The VP didn't put you up to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.75,0:09:11.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Who're you working for?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.75,0:09:14.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hey, get back here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.96,0:09:17.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Looks like the story about the\Ntorn ligament was bullshit.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.54,0:09:18.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're not goin' anywhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.50,0:09:43.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He blocked the entrance?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.13,0:09:54.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oui.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.83,0:09:58.63,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Shit, he lured me here on purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.63,0:10:00.04,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,What is this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.21,0:10:03.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I've trained to be able to fight\Nwithout needing to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.08,0:10:06.25,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Is this guy the spy killer they warned me about?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.25,0:10:08.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This prison of darkness will be your grave.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.38,0:10:15.13,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,They look like they mean business.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.58,0:10:16.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You looking for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.96,0:10:17.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll give you credit.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.96,0:10:19.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It was pretty sporting of you to come at me head-on.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.79,0:10:22.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hello there.\NWe're with the Mitario Police Department.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.75,0:10:28.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.04,0:10:30.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Coming as cops was a bold move.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.21,0:10:33.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Did you really think those disguises would fool me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.67,0:10:35.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Disguises?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.71,0:10:37.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.71,0:10:40.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wait, you're actual cops?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.33,0:10:43.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Long story short, you're a suspect in a murder case.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.79,0:10:47.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Two people were shot to death the night before last.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.33,0:10:50.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There's an eyewitness who puts you there,\Nand we have a warrant.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.29,0:10:52.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No, wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.04,0:10:55.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Th-this is a frame job!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.04,0:10:57.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A Galgad spy's trying to set me up!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.46,0:11:01.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And why would a spy go after some random\Nexchange student who works at a burger joint?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.88,0:11:03.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What's their motive?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.08,0:11:05.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Um, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.00,0:11:10.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This, uh, this isn't what it looks like!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.79,0:11:14.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Lillian Hepburn, you're under arrest\Nfor suspected murder.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.46,0:11:16.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,U-under arrest?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.67,0:11:20.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I hate to break it to you,\Nbut you're not the first prodigy I've run across.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.00,0:11:21.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's rare, but it happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.17,0:11:25.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But even for prodigies who can throw\Nperfect games like it's nothing,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.42,0:11:29.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,their composure crumbles in an instant\Nwhen their lives are on the line.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.42,0:11:34.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I wonder how long you'll be able to keep your cool\Nnow that you know the truth?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.29,0:11:35.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Look at it the other way round.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.50,0:11:42.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If I win, it'll mean you served yourself\Nup on a silver platter for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.88,0:11:44.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Makes my job real easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.54,0:11:48.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Who hired you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.25,0:11:50.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Once I beat you, I'll make you sing like a bird.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.33,0:11:53.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Could you not write me off so easily?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.58,0:12:03.63,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Its trajectory shifted?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.92,0:12:07.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How embarrassing.\NAnd after you talked such a big game.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.50,0:12:12.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Take a good, long look.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.25,0:12:15.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is the moment your whole life ends.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.92,0:12:27.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They're late.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.13,0:12:29.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Why aren't they reporting in\Nlike they're supposed to?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.04,0:12:31.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What happened, do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.79,0:12:33.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's a good question.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.25,0:12:36.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The most likely answer is that\Nthey've been caught by surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.38,0:12:41.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We all share a common weakness,\Nso I'm a little bit concerned.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.50,0:12:44.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What weakness is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.67,0:12:49.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We do all our training by going after the boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.83,0:12:54.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,In other words, we practice attacking,\Nbut we're not used to having to defend ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.50,0:12:57.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm sure it will be fine, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.17,0:13:00.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I've prepared measures for just such an eventuality.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.83,0:13:03.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A small spy can make a big difference.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.21,0:13:07.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Because if there's one time where we truly shine...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.33,0:13:10.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How unlucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.50,0:13:15.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What're you talkin' about, unlucky?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.46,0:13:16.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That was perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.46,0:13:17.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oui.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.67,0:13:18.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Backup, hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.88,0:13:20.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Tough luck, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.13,0:13:24.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,As soon as we survived your first attack,\Nyour defeat was already sealed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.96,0:13:28.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If there's one time where we truly shine...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.88,0:13:30.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,it's when we go on the offensive.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.04,0:13:34.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is all an Imperial spy's conspiracy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.88,0:13:36.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm being set up!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.54,0:13:37.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Is she still going on about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.71,0:13:39.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hm? What's with the stuffed animal on your back?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.17,0:13:43.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wh-what's going on?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.17,0:13:47.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's a stun gun?\NDoes that mean-
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.38,0:13:51.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yo, Sis, we gotta book it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.54,0:13:52.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Annette!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.21,0:13:55.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She missed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.21,0:13:56.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's a single 20!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.08,0:13:58.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Th-there was a mouse!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.54,0:14:01.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It threw itself against my ankle!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.38,0:14:02.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.58,0:14:03.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Who cares, lady?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.29,0:14:08.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's a pretty sad excuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.04,0:14:26.29,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,I threw my dart perfectly.\NSo, why?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.75,0:14:31.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Come on, it's your turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.92,0:14:36.42,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,The AC unit?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.21,0:14:42.63,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,It's only blowing when I take my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.96,0:14:45.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?\NLost your nerve?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.88,0:14:48.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Gosh, I hope your darts don't go\Nflying the wrong way again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.63,0:14:50.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So, it was you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.13,0:14:52.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Who, me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.67,0:14:54.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Let me tell you a secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.17,0:14:57.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Down here, all that matters is where your darts land.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.88,0:14:59.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, don't you worry about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.75,0:15:02.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I already have a solution.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.08,0:15:14.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, it worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.67,0:15:16.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Did you seriously just...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.42,0:15:21.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I lived here in the States for a bit during the war.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.46,0:15:24.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Around these parts,\Nyou call that a windup pitch, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.75,0:15:27.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There's no way you can keep pulling off flukes like-
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.04,0:15:34.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.21,0:15:37.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.67,0:15:38.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What's everyone watching?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.29,0:15:49.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,At this rate, we'll never be done.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.33,0:15:53.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What do you say we start throwing\Nall three darts at once?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.83,0:15:55.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Have you lost it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.58,0:15:56.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What, too chicken?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.79,0:15:58.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.13,0:16:11.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm here to play darts, not perform stunts.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.00,0:16:12.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What're you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.38,0:16:13.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Coward!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.63,0:16:15.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Throw all three!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.46,0:16:16.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Do it! Do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.67,0:16:17.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Live a little!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.54,0:16:25.38,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,She's distracted.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.38,0:16:33.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hurry it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.79,0:16:39.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Why the surprised face?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.71,0:16:41.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Did you think you'd won?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.38,0:16:42.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's no use.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.67,0:16:45.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Nothing you do can shake me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.00,0:16:48.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's the stuff, right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.83,0:16:57.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I've put in the hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.25,0:17:00.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I've thrown tens, hundreds of thousands of darts.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.17,0:17:03.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're saying that's the difference between us?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.42,0:17:06.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's right.\NAnd it's why I don't get tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.92,0:17:09.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.92,0:17:17.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The reason you keep doing that\Nthree-at-once stunt
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.21,0:17:19.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,is to bring down the total number of throws\Nyou have to make.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.92,0:17:22.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That stance you're taking\Nputs a lot of strain on your arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.96,0:17:24.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sooner or later, you'll mess up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.92,0:17:27.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Not even prodigies are immune to fatigue.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.92,0:17:29.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're in the same boat, no?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.71,0:17:31.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Didn't I just tell you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.83,0:17:33.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I don't get tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.67,0:17:36.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Someone like you would never understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.67,0:17:40.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You have no idea just how long I've spent\Nhoning my technique.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.17,0:17:43.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I could throw a thousand darts and never miss once.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.54,0:17:47.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Why go that far?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.21,0:17:49.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Because of the pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.04,0:17:51.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The what?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.04,0:17:53.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There's a man whispering in my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.04,0:17:55.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,"Keep training," he says.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.38,0:17:58.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And if I defy him, the pain comes back.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.42,0:18:00.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's agony.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.71,0:18:01.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And that's why...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.75,0:18:06.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.63,0:18:10.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That if I work hard enough,\NI'll be able to overcome any adversity!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.54,0:18:14.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Can you say the same?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.54,0:18:16.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Your arm doesn't look like it can take much more.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.25,0:18:23.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Going back to throwing them one at a time?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.42,0:18:27.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Won't that just increase the\Nnumber of throws you have to make?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.29,0:18:35.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's only one point.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.46,0:18:36.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I guess that settles it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.50,0:18:41.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You finally hit your limit.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.33,0:18:44.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hold on, I've still got one dart left.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.25,0:18:45.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It won't change a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.63,0:18:47.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You failed to overcome me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.33,0:18:50.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I love moments like these.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.75,0:18:54.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It always feels wonderful to have\Nhard work outdo raw talent.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.17,0:18:58.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Miss Monika, you need to run!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.04,0:19:06.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,On its own, hard work isn't worth jack.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.63,0:19:09.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You've trained hard, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.08,0:19:12.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But that alone isn't enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.17,0:19:14.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What are you babbling about?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.83,0:19:15.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You piss me off.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.83,0:19:18.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You, and your shitty value system.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.92,0:19:21.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,"Hard work is enough to overcome any adversity"?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.92,0:19:25.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How many people do you think die in\Nthis world awash in pain of ours
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.67,0:19:29.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,just because they were born in the wrong place\Nor without enough talent?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.75,0:19:31.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Remember this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.58,0:19:34.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,In our world, people without fire in their hearts
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.63,0:19:36.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,are nothing more than garbage.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.88,0:19:40.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There are walls.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.08,0:19:42.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Walls that no amount of hard work\Nwill ever let you scale.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.42,0:19:48.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's infuriating, the way you pretend to be a nobody\Nwhen you're just as talented yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.04,0:19:50.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Are you done making pointless speeches?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.08,0:19:52.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is game, set, and match.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.08,0:19:54.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You want to know why you lost?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.63,0:19:59.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's your talent you should have trusted in,\Nnot your hard work.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.04,0:20:12.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's 121 to 120.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.75,0:20:14.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The win's mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.21,0:20:16.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Y-you think this is a joke?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.29,0:20:18.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You cheated!\NWe all saw it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.50,0:20:20.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Remember what you just said?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.42,0:20:24.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,"Down here, all that matters is where your darts land."
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.17,0:20:30.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,All told, that's 890,100 donnies you owe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.50,0:20:32.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It'd take most people twenty years to earn that much.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.33,0:20:36.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If you can't pay, I'd be happy to spot you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.25,0:20:39.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,All I'd ask for in return is intel\Non the person who hired-
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.83,0:20:51.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Where's my gratitude?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.04,0:20:53.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Th-thank you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.04,0:20:55.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Allow me to introduce you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.54,0:20:57.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This here is my pet dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.67,0:21:02.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Up until five years ago,\Nhe was a med student at Mitario University.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.46,0:21:06.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They called him a boy genius,\Nand his grades were outstanding.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.33,0:21:10.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Now, though, he's nothing more than a mangy mutt.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.50,0:21:14.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And it's all because of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.75,0:21:16.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I have a gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.13,0:21:17.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,All my life, I've known.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.75,0:21:21.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I've known what kind of pain will chisel fear\Ndeep into people's minds.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.13,0:21:26.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Give me a week with anyone,\Nand I can make them fall in line.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.42,0:21:29.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If I order them to die, then that's what they'll do.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.46,0:21:34.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The pain I offer rewrites people's brains.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.71,0:21:36.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It isn't logic that makes them obey me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.83,0:21:38.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's their primal instincts.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.42,0:21:42.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Students, martial artists,\Npolice officers, bank workers,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.00,0:21:45.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,actresses, and killers alike\Nprostrate themselves before their king.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.96,0:21:50.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They spend their days\Nblending in with ordinary society.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.46,0:21:53.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,By night, though, they hone\Ntheir assassination techniques for me
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.88,0:21:56.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,like men and women possessed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.21,0:22:00.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You and your friends didn't stand a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.58,0:22:03.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They hunt down spies\Nfor as long as they draw breath,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.13,0:22:05.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and when they fail, they kill themselves on the spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.00,0:22:08.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's how my Worker Ants operate.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.38,0:22:31.96,Song,,0,0,0,,Ah, standing on one leg and feeling the pain
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.79,0:22:37.79,Song,,0,0,0,,I've shared it with you, are you getting this vertigo?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.25,0:22:43.63,Song,,0,0,0,,I've got love, but that's not what's washing over me
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.79,0:22:49.17,Song,,0,0,0,,I spring up, I spring up, I'm a nuisance and I'm in the way
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.58,0:22:52.21,Song,,0,0,0,,Am I "really okay"?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.21,0:22:54.83,Song,,0,0,0,,What good will asking that do?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.00,0:23:00.25,Song,,0,0,0,,Just praise me and be on your way
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.38,0:23:04.00,Song,,0,0,0,,Blame it on a mirror that's unspeakable, unhealable
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.00,0:23:07.38,Song,,0,0,0,,A sullied life that's unseeable, unfading
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.54,0:23:12.04,Song,,0,0,0,,Tear right on through and see through lies with frigid eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.25,0:23:14.92,Song,,0,0,0,,An innocent item that's unbeatable, unbuyable
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.92,0:23:18.25,Song,,0,0,0,,It's an undiscarded corpse, after all
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.46,0:23:23.75,Song,,0,0,0,,Fight back naked with your unconcealed resolve in hand
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.88,0:23:26.13,Song,,0,0,0,,(whoo, whoo, ooh)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.13,0:23:29.13,Song,,0,0,0,,A wishy-washy destiny all covered in graffiti
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.33,0:23:31.63,Song,,0,0,0,,(whoo, whoo, ooh)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.63,0:23:35.25,Song,,0,0,0,,Recklessly deceiving even God
